# Product defaults

- Domain: dental clinic marketing + appointment booking (not a generic SaaS template).
- Tone: professional, calm, trustworthy; avoid playful consumer-app copy.
- Accessibility: keyboard-accessible tabs, expandable bios, and booking forms; gallery images need alt text.
- Routes to preserve: `/` (home sections), `/services/[slug]` (treatment pages). Add `/book` only if the booking CTA needs a full page; prefer a modal that reuses the same form as the home embed.
- When adding features (auth, admin, payments), keep the public IA above intact.
